<p>You are viewing the NeMo 2.0 documentation. This release introduces significant changes to the API and a new library, <a class="reference external" href="https://github.com/NVIDIA/NeMo-Run">NeMo Run</a>. We are currently porting all features from NeMo 1.0 to 2.0. For documentation on previous versions or features not yet available in 2.0, please refer to the <a class="reference external" href="https://docs.nvidia.com/nemo-framework/user-guide/24.07/overview.html">NeMo 24.07 documentation</a>.</p>
